          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento lwak ducu guliŋ aliŋa, pe gudokke iye lok mo kadi ki acel, pien onoŋo kabaka ociko ni, “Pe wubigamo doge.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliakim wod pa Ilkia ma en aye ladit ma loyo jami ma i ot pa kabaka, kacel ki Cebna ma karan, ki Joa wod pa Acap ma laco lok matimme guyeco boŋŋigi, gucito kwede wa bot Kejekia gutitte lok ducu ma Rabcake owaco.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.37"
            ]
          }
        }
